        <takesPlaceIn rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/chris/ontologies/caverne-di-qud#Eaters_Tomb"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Barathrum sends the player to ascend the Tomb of the Eaters and reach Herodododicus, in order to shut down the magnetic field that guards the Spindle. The reward is a vial of metamorphic polygel.</rdfs:comment>
